## REQUIRED PHRASES

Agent MUST produce ALL of these in output.

### Subject Line (Exact Format)
```
WSR | {dd-mmm-yy auto-today} | {Project Name} | Status - {Green|Amber|Red} | {Region}
```

### Body Headers (Exact Strings)
- `Summary of WSR:`
- `Overall Delivery status` (followed by `is` + color)
- `GDC project status` (followed by `is` + color)
- `Ask for/ Attention required by Leaders:`
- `Ask :` (note space before colon — matches Heineken reference)
- `Attention:`
- `Delivery Metrics & Quality Details:`

### Metric Labels (Exact Strings)
- `Capacity Utilisation` (British `s`)
- `User Story Delivered`
- `Defects Per Days` (column header: `Defect Per Days (DpD)`)

### Send Instructions (SP2 final handoff)
- *"Compose a FRESH email — do NOT Reply or Forward."*
- *"TO: gdc-project-collaboration@salesforce.com"*

### Default Content
- Empty Ask → `Ask : None as of now`

### v1.1 Inference Markers
- `[from reference]` — beside any field auto-extracted by `prior_email_parser.py`
- `⚠️ INFERRED — confirm` — beside any LOW-confidence inference
- `⚠️ MISSING — please provide {detail}` — beside any field neither inferred nor provided
- `[auto: today's date]` — beside the date in SP1 batch (proof it was auto-set)

