## SEMANTIC ANTI-AUTOPILOT

| Anti-Pattern | Correct Behavior |
|--------------|-------------------|
| Asking for the date | Auto-inject today via `date "+%d-%b-%y"` |
| Re-asking project name when reference provided it | Show `[from reference]` in SP1 batch instead |
| Splitting Phase 1 into multiple sub-questions | Single batch only |
| Auto-picking Green because "it feels positive" | Inherit from reference; surface bidirectional sycophancy nudge if status–blockers conflict |
| Filling Summary with inferred bullets from neither reference nor user input | STOP; flag `⚠️ MISSING` |
| Skipping SP2 if validation passed silently | STOP; user must still approve final draft |
| Rendering HTML with `{placeholder}` left unsubstituted | STOP; mark as MISSING |
| Replying *"no problem, I'll proceed assuming..."* | FORBIDDEN; ask in SP1 batch |
| Treating *"trust you, just compose it"* as permission to invent | Evidence-bound only; flag every gap |

